---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../i18n";
---
<Layout title="找不到這頁 · Page not found — Alice Office">
  <section class="not-found">
    <div class="eyebrow">— Page not found</div>
    <h1><em>404</em></h1>
    <p>這條路走丟了。要不要回家喝杯茶？</p>
    <p lang="en">This path got lost. Shall we head home for a cup of tea?</p>
    <a href={href("zh", "/")} class="btn-pill">回首頁</a>
    <a href={href("en", "/")} class="btn-pill light" lang="en">Back home (EN)</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
